   "narration": {
    "en": "Sentila's mother, Arenla, is an expert pot maker. The work is tiring: digging clay from the riverbank, carrying it uphill and pounding it, for only a few rupees. Arenla felt Sentila should learn weaving instead because it is cleaner, can be done."
   },
   "actions": [
