   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "narration": {
    "en": "Arenla finally taught Sentila to dig clay and soak and pound it, but for almost a year Sentila could not shape even one pot and felt shame and frustration. When Sentila matured, she stayed in a girls' dormitory under a kind widow called Onula, who."
