  {
   "id": "d4",
   "narration": {
    "en": "With new confidence Sentila made a pot. Onula told her to watch how her mother shaped the mouth of the pot. On a sunny day Arenla left Sentila alone with a headache as an excuse. Sentila made pot after pot, almost matching her mother's tally."
